ding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>Il n'y a pas de cinéma.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · There is no cinema.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>C'est loin du centre.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · It's far from the centre.</span></li><li style=\"padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);\"><b>C'est une ville animée.</b><span style=\"opacity:.7;\"> · It's a lively town.</span></li></ul>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":0}},{"id":"zY598xs7qnYSXlDKARZi","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":3,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p03-b1","partTitle":"Say it 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Il y a un grand marché.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">There is a big market.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Il y a un grand marché.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":50000000}},{"id":"VAeRZxWSBeXRIfzzZYEx","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":4,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p04-b1","partTitle":"Say it 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Il n'y a pas de cinéma.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">There is no cinema.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"Il n'y a pas de cinéma.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":48000000}},{"id":"6fqT45QcbQ041tA4XhbH","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":5,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p05-b1","partTitle":"Say it 3/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>C'est loin du centre.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">It's far from the centre.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"C'est loin du centre.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275988,"_nanoseconds":998000000}},{"id":"35bWiNTA6PBRgd1IpeNu","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":6,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p06-b1","partTitle":"Say it 4/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.7rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>C'est une ville animée.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0;\">It's a lively town.</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Listen, then say it!","expectedText":"C'est une ville animée.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":514000000}},{"id":"bjHBRpddpq2Bbj6mmJtf","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":7,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p07-b1","partTitle":"Listen to the conversation","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"opacity:.8;\">Read and listen to the whole conversation first. You play the “You” part next.</p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Vous habitez dans quelle ville ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Which town do you live in?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>J'habite à Accra, c'est la capitale du Ghana.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I live in Accra, it's the capital of Ghana.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Qu'est-ce qu'il y a dans votre quartier ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">What is there in your neighbourhood?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Il y a un marché, une école et des restaurants.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">There is a market, a school and restaurants.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Il y a un cinéma ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Is there a cinema?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Non, il n'y a pas de cinéma, mais il y a un grand centre commercial.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">No, there is no cinema, but there is a big mall.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>C'est calme ou animé ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Is it calm or lively?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>C'est très animé, surtout le soir.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's very lively, especially in the evening.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":525000000}},{"id":"YQXWGVIise2Vbnn6Cdpu","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p08-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Vous habitez dans quelle ville ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Which town do you live in?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">J'habite à Accra, c'est la capitale du Ghana.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I live in Accra, it's the capital of Ghana.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"J'habite à Accra, c'est la capitale du Ghana.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793275989,"_nanoseconds":562000000}},{"id":"QaCeXKu9mOClmBE3uxqN","level":"a1","lesson":20,"part":9,"type":"text","name":"a1-l20-p09-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 2/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍